...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI (health_agent.py) { class: ours }
session: 세션 상태 (dietary_plan·fitness_plan·qa_pairs) { class: store }

agents: 독립된 Agent 3개 {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 3
  dietary: Dietary Expert (Agent) { class: ours }
  fitness: Fitness Expert (Agent) { class: ours }
  qa: Q&A 에이전트 (Agent) { class: ours }
}

gemini: "Gemini API (gemini-2.5-flash-preview-05-20, 2025-11-18 종료)" { class: ext }

user -> ui: 프로필 입력·질문
ui -> agents: user_profile·맥락 전달
agents -> gemini: 시스템 메시지 + user_profile / 맥락·질문
ui -> session: dietary_plan·fitness_plan·qa_pairs 저장
session -> ui: 재실행 시 저장된 값 조회
ui -> user: 계획·답변 렌더링
